  "title": "Phoenix New Media to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Tuesday, August 11, 2026",
  "summary": "BEIJING, Aug. 5, 2026 – Phoenix New Media Limited (“Phoenix New Media”, “ifeng” or the “Company”) (NYSE: FENG), a leading new media company in China, today announced that it will report its second quarter 2026 financial results on Tuesday, August 11, 2026 after the U.S. market closes.",
